{
  "english": [
    {
      "offset": 7807124,
      "raw_bytes": "",
      "length": 246,
      "text": "When Pokémon evolve, they get\nstronger.<0xFB>But there is a benefit for not\nevolving your Pokémon right away.<0xFB>Pokémon that can still evolve can\nutilise an <0xFC><0x01><0x06>Eviolite<0xFC><0x01><0x08> to become<0xFA>tougher to beat in battle.<0xFB>I have an extra, so why don't you\ntake one?",
      "pointer_offsets": [
        "0x00762C7F"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": 7866590,
      "raw_bytes": "bfe4ddd8dde1ed00cee3ebe2fbcedcd900e8e3ebe200e3da00dcd5e4e4dde2d9e7e700d5e2d800d6e0dde7e7adff",
      "length": 46,
      "text": "Epidimy Town<0xFB>The town of happiness and bliss.",
      "pointer_offsets": [
        "0x0074B0E1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": 7867956,
      "raw_bytes": "bbe200d5e8e8d5d7df00ebdcddd7dc00e1d5edfee0d9d5ead900e8dcd900e8d5e6dbd9e8fedae6e3eed9e2ad00c3e800dde700d5e0e7e3fee7e9e4d9e600d9dadad9d7e8ddead900e3e2fed1d5e8d9e600e8ede4d9e7adff",
      "length": 88,
      "text": "An attack which may\nleave the target\nfrozen. It is also\nsuper effective on\nWater types.",
      "pointer_offsets": [
        "0x009047D0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": 7869049,
      "raw_bytes": "bb00e4d9d7e9e0ddd5e600e7e8e3e2d900e8dcd5e800e1d5dfd9e700d7d9e6e8d5dde2fee7e4d9d7ddd9e700e3da00cae3df1be1e3e200d9eae3e0ead9adfec3e800e7e4d5e6dfe0d9e700e0dddfd900d9edd9e7adff",
      "length": 86,
      "text": "A peculiar stone that makes certain\nspecies of Pokémon evolve.\nIt sparkles like eyes.",
      "pointer_offsets": [
        "0x00877344"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": 7870057,
      "raw_bytes": "d3e3e9e600cae3df1be1e3e200d5e6d900e0e3e3dfdde2db00e1e9d7dcfed6d9e8e8d9e600e2e3ebb800fd02adff",
      "length": 46,
      "text": "Your Pokémon are looking much\nbetter now, <0xFD><0x02>.",
      "pointer_offsets": [
        "0x00765974"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": 7897686,
      "raw_bytes": "c2e3eb00e1d5e2ed00e8dce3e9e7d5e2d8e700e3da00edd9d5e6e700dcd5ead900c3fed6d9d9e200e3e9e800dcd9e6d9b0fbc3da00e3e2e0ed00c300d7e3e9e0d800e0e3e7d9b800e1ed00dee3e9e6e2d9edfeebe3e9e0d800d9e2d8b0ff",
      "length": 94,
      "text": "How many thousands of years have I\nbeen out here\"<0xFB>If only I could lose, my journey\nwould end\"",
      "pointer_offsets": [
        "0x007C871E",
        "0x007C8745"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": 7898424,
      "raw_bytes": "fc0108c3b4e100e7e3e6e6ed00d5d6e3e9e800e8dcdde7adfbced5dfd900e8dcdde700dae3e600ede3e9e600e8e6e3e9d6e0d9adff",
      "length": 53,
      "text": "<0xFC><0x01><0x08>I'm sorry about this.<0xFB>Take this for your trouble.",
      "pointer_offsets": [
        "0x00771912"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": 7914153,
      "raw_bytes": "cce3e9e8d900a2a3ff",
      "length": 9,
